From ab2db6dbd1dcebb7e326701ce3f0bd4297a18457 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ahmed Amine HAOUES <ahmed-amine.haoues_ext@softathome.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 10:27:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 28/41] epFh: add new feature to pause radio's fronthaul(VAPs)
 while connecting backhaul(EPs)

New feature:
- based on monitoring the radio's backhaul endpoint connection status,
this feature allows to control pausinh radio's fronthaul beaconing while
backhaul endpoint is trying to connect, and restore the fronthaul, with
a delay, after the backhaul connection try has finished
- the actions to stop and restore fronthaul are based on dedicated FTA
handlers to be implemented by the plugin/vendorModules

References: PPM-4222
Signed-off-by: Ahmed Amine HAOUES <ahmed-amine.haoues_ext@softathome.com>
Upstream-Status: Backport [https://gitlab.com/prpl-foundation/prplmesh/pwhm/plugins/pwhm/-/commit/840e7e92ea85f6369dde8b564e3bf1ff4291ea5d]
